{"strongs": "H0631", "word": "אָסַר", "translit": "a.sar", "root": "אסר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "tie, bind, imprison", "definition": "[ אָסַר ] verb tie, bind, imprison (Arabic , Assyrian asâru , compare COT Gloss , Aramaic אֲסַר , , Ethiopic ) — Qal Perfect suffix אֲסָרָם Job 36:13 3 feminine singular אָֽסְרָה Num 30:5 +, etc.; Imperfect יֶאְסֹר 1Kgs 20:14 וַיֶּאֱסֹר Gen 42:24 וַיֶּאְסֹר Gen 46:29 +; plural suffix יַאַסְרֻנִי Judg 16:7 etc.; Imperative אֱסֹר 1Kgs 18:44 ; 2Kgs 9:21 אִסְרוּ Jer 46:4 ; Ps 118:27 Infinitive absolute אָסֹר Judg 15:13 אָסוֺר Judg 16:11 construct לָאְסֹר Num 30:3 +; לָאֱסוֺר Judg 15:10 לֶאֱסָרְךָ Judg 15:12 אָסְרָם Hos 10:10 Participle active construct אֹסְרִי Gen 49:11 passive אָסור Gen 40:3 +; plural אֲסוּרִים Gen 39:20 +; also Judg 16:21 ; Judg 16:25 Qr ( Kt אסירים ); הָסוּרִים Eccl 4:14 (compare Now ); אֲסֻרוֺת 2Sam 3:34 construct אסורי Gen 39:20 Kt ( Qr אֲסִירֵי ); — 1. tie, bind , for security, foal to vine (followed by ל ) Gen 49:11 (blessing of Jacob); horses and asses 2Kgs 7:10 (twice in verse); Ps 118:27 is dubious De bind the festal victim with cords ; Che bind the procession with branches , etc. 2. tie, harness , kine to ( ב ) cart 1Sam 6:7 ; 1Sam 6:10 so (metaphor) Hos 10:10 harness them to ( ל ) their two iniquities (but Jerome Ew Now make ׳ א here = יסר chastise , compare אֶסֳּרֵם v a ); also followed by accusative chariot Gen 46:29 ( J ) Exod 14:6 ( E ) 2Kgs 9:21 absolute 1Kgs 18:44 ; 2Kgs 9:21 even of making ready chargers הַסּוּסִים ׳ א Jer 46:4 (|| עֲלוּ הַפָּרָשִׁים ). 3. bind , with cords, fetters, etc., as prisoner, Simeon Gen 42:24 ( E ), Samson Judg 15:10 ; Judg 15:12 ; Judg 15:13 (3 t. in verse); Judg 16:5 ; Judg 16:7 ; Judg 16:8 ; Judg 16:11 (twice in verse); Judg 16:12 בַּנְחֻשְׁתַּיִם ׳ א 2Kgs 25:7 = 2Chr 36:6 = Jer 39:7 ; Jer 52:11 also 2Chr 33:11 compare (without ׳ בַּנ ) 2Kgs 17:4 ( בֵּית בֶּלָא ׳ א || עָצַת ), 2Kgs 23:33 compare of divine chastisement Job 36:13 & see also Ezek 3:25 ; Ps 149:8 figurative of absolute authority Ps 105:22 especially Passive participle 2Sam 3:34 thy hands were not bound (|| and thy feet not put in fetters ); בָּאֿזִקִּים ׳ א Jer 40:1 compare בַּזִּקִּים ׳ א Job 36:8 (probably figurative || חַבְלֵיעֹֿ֑נִי ); metaphor of king held captive by a woman's tresses Song 7:6 perhaps = imprisoned (whether bound or not) Gen 39:20 ; Gen 40:3 ; Gen 40:5 (all J E ); as substantive plural prisoners Gen 39:20 ( Kt , see above); so (late) as distressed, & object of divine compassion Isa 49:9 ; Isa 61:1 ; Ps 146:7 בֵּית האסי֯רים prison Judg 16:21 ; Judg 16:25 compare Eccl 4:14 . 4. gird (rare & late) אֵזוֺר בְּמָתְנֵיהֶם ׳ א Job 12:18 ( אֵזוֺר = slaves' waistcloth, RS p. 25 above; Hoffm reads וַיָּסַר for וַיֶּאְסֹר ); חַרְבּוֺ אֲסוּרִים עַלמָֿתְנָיו Neh 4:12 . 5. followed by מִלְחָמָה begin the battle, make the attack (compare German mit jemandem anbinden ) 1Kgs 20:14 ; 2Chr 13:3 . 6. figurative of obligation of oath or vow (only Num 30 , P ) עַלנֶֿפֶשׁ ׳ א , usually followed by accusative of congnate meaning with verb אֱסָר , אִסָּר Num 30:3 ; Num 30:5 (twice in verse); Num 30:6 ; Num 30:8 ; Num 30:9 ; Num 30:11 ; Num 30:12 without אֱסָר etc., v. Num 30:7 v. Num 30:10 compare v. Num 30:4 אִסָּר ׳ א ( עַלנֶֿפֶשׁ omitted) Niph`al passive of Qal 3 , be, bound, imprisoned, Imperfect (jussive) יֵאָסֵר Gen 42:19 ( E ); 2 masculine singular תֵּאָסֵר Judg 16:6 ; Judg 16:10 ; Judg 16:13 (of Samson); Imperative הֵאָֽסְרוּ Gen 42:16 ( E ). Pu`al Perfect be taken prisoner אֻסְּרוּ Isa 22:3 אֻסָּ֑רוּ ib.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB636')\">BDB636</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H631')\">H631</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H612')\">H612</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB635')\">BDB635</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB637')\">BDB637</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>אָסַר</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>tie, bind, imprison</highlightword> (Arabic <placeholder346/>, Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>asâru</highlight></transliteration>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('COT')\">COT<sup>Gloss</sup></lookup>, Aramaic <bdbarc>אֲסַר</bdbarc>, <placeholder347/>, Ethiopic <placeholder348/>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>אֲסָרָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 36:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,13)\">Job 36:13</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>אָֽסְרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,5)\">Num 30:5</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יֶאְסֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,14)\">1Kgs 20:14</ref> <bdbheb>וַיֶּאֱסֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,24)\">Gen 42:24</ref> <bdbheb>וַיֶּאְסֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 46:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,29)\">Gen 46:29</ref> +; plural suffix <bdbheb>יַאַסְרֻנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 16:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,7)\">Judg 16:7</ref> etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>אֱסֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:44\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,44)\">1Kgs 18:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,21)\">2Kgs 9:21</ref> <bdbheb>אִסְרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,4)\">Jer 46:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 118:27\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,27)\">Ps 118:27</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>אָסֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 15:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,13)\">Judg 15:13</ref> <bdbheb>אָסוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 16:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,11)\">Judg 16:11</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לָאְסֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,3)\">Num 30:3</ref> +; <bdbheb>לָאֱסוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 15:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,10)\">Judg 15:10</ref> <bdbheb>לֶאֱסָרְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 15:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,12)\">Judg 15:12</ref> <bdbheb>אָסְרָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 10:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,10)\">Hos 10:10</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> construct <bdbheb>אֹסְרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,11)\">Gen 49:11</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbheb>אָסור</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 40:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,40,3)\">Gen 40:3</ref> +; plural <bdbheb>אֲסוּרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 39:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,39,20)\">Gen 39:20</ref> +; also <ref ref=\"Judg 16:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,21)\">Judg 16:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,25)\">Judg 16:25</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>אסירים</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>הָסוּרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 4:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,4,14)\">Eccl 4:14</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup>); <bdbheb>אֲסֻרוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,34)\">2Sam 3:34</ref> construct <bdbheb>אסורי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 39:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,39,20)\">Gen 39:20</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>אֲסִירֵי</bdbheb>); — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>tie, bind</highlight>, for security, foal to vine (followed by <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Gen 49:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,11)\">Gen 49:11</ref> (blessing of Jacob); horses and asses <ref ref=\"2Kgs 7:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,7,10)\">2Kgs 7:10</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ps 118:27\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,27)\">Ps 118:27</ref> is dubious <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <highlight>bind the festal victim with cords</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <highlight>bind the procession with branches</highlight>, etc. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>tie, harness</highlight>, kine to (<bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>) cart <ref ref=\"1Sam 6:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,6,7)\">1Sam 6:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 6:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,6,10)\">1Sam 6:10</ref> so (metaphor) <ref ref=\"Hos 10:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,10)\">Hos 10:10</ref> <highlight>harness them to</highlight> (<bdbheb>ל</bdbheb>) <highlight>their two iniquities</highlight> (but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Jer')\">Jerome</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> make <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> here = <bdbheb>יסר</bdbheb> <highlight>chastise</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>אֶסֳּרֵם</bdbheb> v<sup>a</sup>); also followed by accusative <highlight>chariot</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 46:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,29)\">Gen 46:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Exod 14:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,6)\">Exod 14:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,21)\">2Kgs 9:21</ref> absolute <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:44\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,44)\">1Kgs 18:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,21)\">2Kgs 9:21</ref> even of making ready chargers <bdbheb>הַסּוּסִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,4)\">Jer 46:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עֲלוּ הַפָּרָשִׁים</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>bind</highlight>, with cords, fetters, etc., as prisoner, Simeon <ref ref=\"Gen 42:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,24)\">Gen 42:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), Samson <ref ref=\"Judg 15:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,10)\">Judg 15:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 15:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,12)\">Judg 15:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 15:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,13)\">Judg 15:13</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Judg 16:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,5)\">Judg 16:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,7)\">Judg 16:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,8)\">Judg 16:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,11)\">Judg 16:11</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Judg 16:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,12)\">Judg 16:12</ref> <bdbheb>בַּנְחֻשְׁתַּיִם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,7)\">2Kgs 25:7</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,6)\">2Chr 36:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 39:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,7)\">Jer 39:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 52:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,11)\">Jer 52:11</ref> also <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,11)\">2Chr 33:11</ref> compare (without <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּנ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,4)\">2Kgs 17:4</ref> (<bdbheb>בֵּית בֶּלָא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>עָצַת</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,33)\">2Kgs 23:33</ref> compare of divine chastisement <ref ref=\"Job 36:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,13)\">Job 36:13</ref> &amp; see also <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,25)\">Ezek 3:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 149:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"149\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"149\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,149,8)\">Ps 149:8</ref> figurative of absolute authority <ref ref=\"Ps 105:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,22)\">Ps 105:22</ref> especially <highlight>Passive participle</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,34)\">2Sam 3:34</ref> <highlight>thy hands were not bound</highlight> (|| <highlight>and thy feet not put in fetters</highlight>); <bdbheb>בָּאֿזִקִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 40:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,40,1)\">Jer 40:1</ref> compare <bdbheb>בַּזִּקִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 36:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,8)\">Job 36:8</ref> (probably figurative || <bdbheb>חַבְלֵיעֹֿ֑נִי</bdbheb>); metaphor of king held captive by a woman's tresses <ref ref=\"Song 7:6\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,6)\">Song 7:6</ref> perhaps = <highlight>imprisoned</highlight> (whether bound or not) <ref ref=\"Gen 39:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,39,20)\">Gen 39:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 40:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,40,3)\">Gen 40:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 40:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,40,5)\">Gen 40:5</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); as substantive plural <highlight>prisoners</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 39:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,39,20)\">Gen 39:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>, see above); so (late) as distressed, &amp; object of divine compassion <ref ref=\"Isa 49:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,9)\">Isa 49:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 61:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,1)\">Isa 61:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 146:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"146\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"146\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,146,7)\">Ps 146:7</ref> <bdbheb>בֵּית האסי֯רים</bdbheb> <highlight>prison</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 16:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,21)\">Judg 16:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,25)\">Judg 16:25</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 4:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,4,14)\">Eccl 4:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>gird</highlight> (rare &amp; late) <bdbheb>אֵזוֺר בְּמָתְנֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 12:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,18)\">Job 12:18</ref> (<bdbheb>אֵזוֺר</bdbheb> = slaves' waistcloth, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\">RS</lookup> p. 25 above; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hoffm')\">Hoffm</lookup> reads <bdbheb>וַיָּסַר</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>וַיֶּאְסֹר</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>חַרְבּוֺ אֲסוּרִים עַלמָֿתְנָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:12\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,12)\">Neh 4:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> followed by <bdbheb>מִלְחָמָה</bdbheb> <highlight>begin the battle, make the attack</highlight> (compare German <highlight>mit jemandem anbinden</highlight>) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,14)\">1Kgs 20:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 13:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,13,3)\">2Chr 13:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> figurative of obligation of oath or vow (only <ref ref=\"Num 30\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,1)\">Num 30</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <bdbheb>עַלנֶֿפֶשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb>, usually followed by accusative of congnate meaning with verb <bdbheb>אֱסָר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אִסָּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,3)\">Num 30:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,5)\">Num 30:5</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Num 30:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,6)\">Num 30:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,8)\">Num 30:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,9)\">Num 30:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,11)\">Num 30:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,12)\">Num 30:12</ref> without <bdbheb>אֱסָר</bdbheb> etc., v.<ref ref=\"Num 30:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,7)\">Num 30:7</ref> v.<ref ref=\"Num 30:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,10)\">Num 30:10</ref> compare v.<ref ref=\"Num 30:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,4)\">Num 30:4</ref> <bdbheb>אִסָּר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>עַלנֶֿפֶשׁ</bdbheb> omitted) <b>Niph`al</b> passive of Qal <b>3</b>, <highlight>be, bound, imprisoned, Imperfect</highlight> (jussive) <bdbheb>יֵאָסֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,19)\">Gen 42:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תֵּאָסֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 16:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,6)\">Judg 16:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,10)\">Judg 16:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,13)\">Judg 16:13</ref> (of Samson); <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הֵאָֽסְרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,16)\">Gen 42:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>). <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Perfect be taken prisoner</highlight> <bdbheb>אֻסְּרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,3)\">Isa 22:3</ref> <bdbheb>אֻסָּ֑רוּ</bdbheb> <highlight>ib.</highlight> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 36:13", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 36, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Num 30:5", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 30, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Kgs 20:14", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 20, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Gen 42:24", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 42, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Gen 46:29", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 46, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Judg 16:7", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 16, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Kgs 18:44", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 18, "verse": 44}, {"raw": "2Kgs 9:21", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 9, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Jer 46:4", "book": "JER", "chapter": 46, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ps 118:27", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 118, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Judg 15:13", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 15, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Judg 16:11", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 16, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Num 30:3", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 30, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Judg 15:10", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 15, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Judg 15:12", "